{"uid":"711f2b38808c5d2","name":"test_stream_and_non_stream_agree_on_intent","fullName":"test_cases.ai_assistant.test_assistant_流式#test_stream_and_non_stream_agree_on_intent","time":{"start":1793157073900,"stop":1793157076023,"duration":2123},"description":"同一句话，走流式和不流式，判出来的 intent 必须一样。\n\n    为什么值得单测一条：这次改成流式，做法是**新增端点、复用同一套判定逻辑**\n    （提示词、硬拦表、意图分类器都只有一份）。这条用例就是钉住这个前提 ——\n    万一以后有人在流式那条路上顺手改了一句（比如换了个 prompt 拼接），\n    两边的 intent 就会开始飘，而单看任一条都发现不了。\n\n    同样一句话问两次，模型措辞会不一样（温度 0.6），但 **intent 是本地规则算的**，\n    必须每次都一样 —— 这正是它敢拿来当断言的原因。\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>同一句话，走流式和不流式，判出来的 intent 必须一样。</p>\n<pre><code>为什么值得单测一条：这次改成流式，做法是**新增端点、复用同一套判定逻辑**\n（提示词、硬拦表、意图分类器都只有一份）。这条用例就是钉住这个前提 ——\n万一以后有人在流式那条路上顺手改了一句（比如换了个 prompt 拼接），\n两边的 intent 就会开始飘，而单看任一条都发现不了。\n\n同样一句话问两次，模型措辞会不一样（温度 0.6），但 **intent 是本地规则算的**，\n必须每次都一样 —— 这正是它敢拿来当断言的原因。\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"api","time":{"start":1793156874129,"stop":1793156874129,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"hasContent":false,"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_cleanup_guard","time":{"start":1793156874129,"stop":1793156874129,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"hasContent":false,"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_auth_state","time":{"start":1793156874752,"stop":1793156874830,"duration":78},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[{"uid":"b4e6c3c8da6fc002","name":"→ 请求　POST /auth/login","source":"b4e6c3c8da6fc002.txt","type":"text/plain","size":297},{"uid":"40c95eb5d8163d10","name":"← 响应　200 /auth/login","source":"40c95eb5d8163d10.txt","type":"text/plain","size":699}],"parameters":[],"hasContent":true,"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":2,"attachment